examples/pro-micro — fixture world

The .hex file under firmware/ is built from the sibling .ino source:

  arduino-cli compile --fqbn arduino:avr:leonardo --output-dir <dir>

Tool versions used for that image:

  arduino-cli 1.5.1
  arduino:avr core 1.8.8

The Arduino AVR core is LGPL-2.1, so the .hex file is LGPL-2.1-derived
object code. It is fixture data. Bench does not link it.

